  m_text: "Press left mouse click for all weapons. Can also use scroll wheel to change
    between weapons\n\n\n- Full-auto, Low Damage\n\n\n\n- Charge-up attack, must
    hold down left click for 2 seconds or longer. \n\n\n- Homing attack, point mouse
    cursor in the direction of the enemy\n\n\n\n- Semi-Auto\n\n\n\n- Hold Down left
    click to keep Firing"
